#. module: account_followup
#: model:mail.template,body_html:account_followup.demo_followup_email_template_4
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != "
"object.commercial_partner_id.id\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t "
"t-out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>),</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/>,"
"</t>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Despite several reminders, your account is still not "
"settled.\n"
"                        Unless full payment is made in next 8 days, then "
"legal action for the recovery of the debt will be taken without further "
"notice.\n"
"                        I trust that this action will prove unnecessary and "
"details of due payments is printed below.\n"
"                        In case of any queries concerning this matter, do "
"not hesitate to contact our accounting department.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Best Regards,\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not "
"is_html_empty(object._get_followup_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-"
"out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            --\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-"
"out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != "
"object.commercial_partner_id.id\">Hej <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-"
"out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>)</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Hej <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/></"
"t>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Kontoen er fortsat ikke afregnet trods flere "
"rykkere.\n"
"                        Medmindre den fulde betaling modtages inden for de "
"næste 8 dage, vil der blive iværksat retslige skridt til inddrivelse af "
"gælden uden yderligere varsel.\n"
"                        Vi håber, at dette skridt kan undgås. Detaljer om de "
"forfaldne betalinger er angivet nedenfor.\n"
"                        Hvis du har spørgsmål vedrørende denne sag, er du "
"velkommen til at kontakte vores regnskabsafdeling.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Med venlig hilsen\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty"
"(object._get_followup_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible()"
".signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            --\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible()"
".name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "

#. module: account_followup
#: model:mail.template,body_html:account_followup.demo_followup_email_template_2
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != "
"object.commercial_partner_id.id\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t "
"t-out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>),</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/>,"
"</t>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        We are disappointed to see that despite sending a "
"reminder, that your account is now seriously overdue.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        It is essential that immediate payment is made, "
"otherwise we will have to consider placing a stop on your account which "
"means that we will no longer be able to supply your company with (goods/"
"services). Please, take appropriate measures in order to carry out this "
"payment in the next 8 days.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        If there is a problem with paying invoice that we "
"are not aware of, do not hesitate to contact our accounting department, so "
"that we can resolve the matter quickly.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Details of due payments is printed below.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Best Regards,\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not "
"is_html_empty(object._get_followup_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-"
"out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            --\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-"
"out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != "
"object.commercial_partner_id.id\">Hej <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-"
"out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>)</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Hej <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/></"
"t>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Din konto er desværre fortsat alvorligt forfalden "
"trods vores tidligere rykkere.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Det er vigtigt, at betalingen foretages omgående. "
"Ellers bliver vi nødt til at spærre din konto, hvilket vil medføre, at vi "
"ikke længere kan levere varer eller tjenester til din virksomhed. Vi beder "
"dig derfor træffe de nødvendige foranstaltninger for at gennemføre "
"betalingen inden for de næste 8 dage\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Hvis der er problemer med betalingen af en faktura, "
"som vi ikke er opmærksomme på, bedes du kontakte vores regnskabsafdeling, så "
"vi hurtigt kan finde en løsning.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Nedenfor finder du oplysninger om forfaldne "
"betalinger.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Med venlig hilsen\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty"
"(object._get_followup_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible()"
".signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            --\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible()"
".name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "

#. module: account_followup
#: model:mail.template,body_html:account_followup.email_template_followup_1
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != "
"object.commercial_partner_id.id\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t "
"t-out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>),</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/>,"
"</t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        We would like to inform you that your account shows "
"an outstanding balance of <b><t t-"
"out=\"format_amount(object.total_overdue_followup, object.currency_id) or "
"''\"/></b>.\n"
"                        We kindly ask that you settle this amount within the "
"next <b>8 days</b>.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p t-if=\"object._show_pay_now_button()\">\n"
"                        <a t-att-href=\"'/my/invoices/overdue'\" "
"style=\"padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 12px; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: "
"none !important; font-weight: 400; background-color: #875A7B; border: 0px "
"solid #875A7B; border-radius:3px\">Pay now</a>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        If payment has already been made, please disregard "
"this notice.\n"
"                        For any questions or if you need assistance, feel "
"free to contact our accounting department.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        We appreciate your cooperation in resolving this "
"matter.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        Sincerely,\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not "
"is_html_empty(object._get_followup_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <t t-"
"out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <t t-"
"out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != "
"object.commercial_partner_id.id\">Hej <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-"
"out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>)</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Hej <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/></"
"t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        Vi vil gerne gøre dig opmærksom på, at din konto har "
"en udestående saldo på <b><t t-out=\"format_amount"
"(object.total_overdue_followup, object.currency_id) or ''\"/></b>.\n"
"                        Vi beder dig venligst om at betale beløbet inden for "
"de næste <b>8 dage</b>.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p t-if=\"object._show_pay_now_button()\">\n"
"                        <a t-att-href=\"'/my/invoices/overdue'\" "
"style=\"padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 12px; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: "
"none !important; font-weight: 400; background-color: #875A7B; border: 0px "
"solid #875A7B; border-radius:3px\">Betal nu</a>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        Hvis betalingen allerede er gennemført, kan du se "
"bort fra denne meddelelse.\n"
"                        Hvis du har spørgsmål eller har brug for hjælp, er "
"du velkommen til at kontakte vores regnskabsafdeling.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        Vi værdsætter dit samarbejde i forbindelse med "
"håndteringen af denne sag.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        Med venlig hilsen\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty"
"(object._get_followup_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible()"
".signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible()"
".name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "

