#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_followup/models/account_followup_report.py:0
msgid ""
"Dear %s,\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Exception made if there was a mistake of ours, it seems that the following "
"amount stays unpaid. Please, take appropriate measures in order to carry out "
"this payment in the next 8 days.\n"
"\n"
"Would your payment have been carried out after this mail was sent, please "
"ignore this message. Do not hesitate to contact our accounting department.\n"
"\n"
"Best Regards,\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Kære %s\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Hvis vores oplysninger er korrekte, er følgende beløb stadig udestående. Vi "
"beder dig venligst betale det inden for 8 dage.\n"
"\n"
"Hvis betalingen allerede er foretaget, kan du se bort fra denne meddelelse. "
"Kontakt os ved spørgsmål.\n"
"\n"
"Med venlig hilsen\n"
"\n"

#. module: account_followup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_followup/models/account_followup_report.py:0
msgid ""
"Dear client, we kindly remind you that you still have unpaid invoices. "
"Please check them and take appropriate action. %s"
msgstr ""
"Kære kunde. Vi minder venligt om, at der fortsat er ubetalte fakturaer på "
"din konto. Vi beder dig venligst kontrollere og afregne snarest muligt. %s"

